# BIOREFINE AI

AI-Enabled Digital Biorefinery for Intelligent Sugarcane Waste Valorization.

## Features
- Monitors temperature, pH, moisture, pressure, and flow rate.
- Displays alerts when readings exceed demonstration limits.
- Supports simulated and manual sensor readings.
- Shows process status and parameter trends.

## Installation
Install the required packages:

`pip install -r requirements.txt`

## Run the Dashboard

`streamlit run biorefine_ai_dashboard.py`

## Note
This prototype uses simulated or manually entered sensor readings. It is not connected to real industrial sensors or physical actuators.
